nce income. Highlighted as an EOM in the Auditors Report.    4.Orient Green Power (Maharashtra) Private Limited, one of the subsidiaries was struck off based on voluntary application. This investment was adequately provided for in earlier years.    5.Out of the proceeds from rights issue of Rs.23,000 lakhs, till March 31, 2024, the company utilized Rs. 20,967 lakhs towards the objects, GCP and issue expenses.Rs. 2,033 lakhs are placed as fixed deposits. These proceeds are proposed to be utilized by March 31, 2024 and the board approved to extend the utilization till March 31, 2025, subject to shareholders approval.   6.M/s. Delta Renewable Energy Private Limited (Delta) is promoted for developing solar/wind /hybrid model of renewable energy and is yet to start operations.   7.The Board authorized to raise capital through rights issue of equity shares for amounts not exceeding Rs. 25,000 lakhs. Draft letter of offer was filed on February 03, 2024. Upon the observations and directions from SEBI, an updated Draft Letter of Offer was filed.   8.The Code on Social Security, 2020 (the code) enacted  and draft rules released is not effective, will be evaluated once once effective.    9.The figures of the last quarters of the financial year are balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full financial year and published nine month period.    10.Negative numbers in finance cost is due to interest waiver received and in other expenses due to the effects of foreign exchange translations.   11.Figures for the previous period regrouped wherever necessary.", "re_desc_note_seg": "-", "re_dil_eps_bfr_exi": null, "re_dilut_eps_for_cont_dic_opr": "-0.01", "re_diluted_eps": null, "re_excepn_items": null, "re_excepn_items_new": "-35", "re_extraord_items": null, "re_face_val": "10", "re_face_value_debt": null, "re_from_dt": "01-JAN-2024", "re_goi_per_shhd": null, "re_grs_npa": null, "re_grs_npa_per": null, "re_inc_dre_sttr": "0", "re_income_inv": null, "re_int_dis_adv_b